        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural stone plate, cut, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural stone plate, cut, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: 299ccea6-049b-34ff-b12e-e5ff84b1f49f
This data set accounts for 1 kg of natrural stone plate, cut, at the regional storage. 87% are from import, 13% are produced in Switzerland. The imported goods are delivered to Siwtzerland to 51% over Italy, 15% from France, 7% from Germany, 10% from Turkey, 5 % from Spain etc.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of natural stone: 634 kt (import and domestic production)
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_299ccea6-049b-34ff-b12e-e5ff84b1f49f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
